  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Suxaly Ndiago Pig Raising Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Animal husbandry , Beneficiaries: 52, including 39 Women, Description: The purpose of the grant is to provide support to an ethnic minority living in a very isolated and marginalized environment. The activity, pig reproduction and fattening, will provide income and thus help in fighting against poverty while ensuring food security.</narrative>
